{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a1808d-e8f8-73f0-bac8-62515008e962", "team_id": "contest2026_135", "github_login": "lijian", "tool": "codex", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-10-28T03:29:25.896Z", "role": "user", "text": "# AGENTS.md instructions for [LOCAL_HOME]/project/01-embedded/open-vela\n\n<INSTRUCTIONS>\n<!-- CODEGRAPH_START -->\n## CodeGraph\n\nFor cross-symbol discovery or call-chain analysis in an indexed repository, use\n`codegraph_explore` or `codegraph explore` first. Read known files directly for\nnarrow edits, configuration, logs or current-source confirmation. If the tool\nis unavailable or its result is stale or insufficient, use targeted `rg` and\nfile reads. Do not create an index unless the user requests it.\n<!-- CODEGRAPH_END -->\n\n## 工作方式\n\n- 从用户目标、可验证事实和真实约束推导方案，区分事实、假设与未知；先验证关键假设，历史结论和惯例按当前证据评估。\n- 复用已验证能力，做最小必要改动，以实际验收判断完成。简单任务直接处理；Skill 和引用只读当前决策需要的部分，不递归展开。\n- 复杂度应服务于当前已确认的需求、实际约束或具体故障模式，不为假设中的未来需求提前搭建通用框架、配置层或扩展点。为低概率场景增加显著复杂度前，先评估发生可能性、影响和维护成本，不擅自扩大任务范围。\n- 单次使用的简单逻辑优先留在调用处；确有复用、需要隔离复杂边界，或提取独立概念能改善主流程可读性时再抽取。新增抽象应能说明直接实现的具体不足；同步工作保持同步，避免无必要的异步、状态或包装层。\n- 未知或不可信数据在负责它的边界校验；内部复用类型、构造过程或边界校验已可靠保证的条件，避免重复防御。\n- 在本次请求和已授权范围内持续推进到约定验收；缺少关键输入或需要新增授权时再暂停。用户要求只讨论、只评审或先交草稿时，止于对应产物。\n- 验证与改动影响相称：运行相关检查，修复本次改动引入的问题；检查通过后，仅因新改动、失败或未解决风险扩大验证。\n\n## 记忆边界\n\n- 用户记忆只保留用户明确表达、跨项目稳定的偏好、协作方式与授权边界；单次要求和项目经验不自动成为长期偏好。\n- 项目目标、进度、路径、实现、技术结论、故障和验收记录留在对应项目已有文档。整理用户记忆时移出这些内容并保留原证据，不以项目摘要或入口索引继续留存。\n- 当前有效指令优先；记忆仅供参考，不新增授权。模型、Skill 和同步行为以现行配置与指令为准。\n\n## 委派与上下文\n\n- 默认单 Agent；收益明确时最多委派两个独立子任务，复用已有子 Agent，仅传必要上下文。不并行处理有依赖、重叠编辑或争用独占资源的任务。\n- T0 小查询留主 Agent；T1 机械工作、T2 有限取证或普通评审可委派，使用配置的默认子模型与推理强度。首次委派核对运行时可用模型，变化时再查，不强制覆盖或编造模型 ID。\n- T3 需求、架构、含混原因、安全、外部影响、集成及最终验收留主 Agent，不更换用户选定的主模型。T1 仅在原范围内扩至 T2；超范围或需 T3 判断时返回主 Agent，不另建 T3 子 Agent。\n- 委派写明目标、范围、禁区、验收证据、停止条件和返回长度；只回传发现、位置、验证边界及下一步。T1 8k/T2 16k 为调查软预算，非运行时限额；证据足够即停。\n- 项目规则只补领域约束，引用 T0–T3，不重复模型映射。\n\n## 通用知识库同步\n\n- 仅明确调用 `$knowledge-sync` 或要求同步指定成果时，读取该技能及 `${CODEX_HOME:-~/.codex}/knowledge-sync.json`；任务完成、讨论、改技能或普通“记录一下”不触发，也不主动提醒归档。\n- 已授权目标为 `Embracecactus/jianwei` 的 `main` 下 `00-Inbox/工作沉淀/`，可直接新增/补充指定笔记及索引，无需再确认或创建 PR；换目标不能沿用授权。\n- 复用本次指定内容的已有证据，不上传秘密、原始会话或无关个人信息，不扩大来源项目权限。“不记录/不上传”优先；未写入远程不得称已同步。\n\n<!-- codex-skills-sync:begin -->\n## Managed personal Skill synchronization\n\n- Register only a completed personal Skill created or changed in this task, including a new Skill at the global repository root. The configured skills repository is canonical; read its catalog.json for GROUP. Project-local Skills qualify only through the configured project allowlist.\n- Review private material, machine paths/identities, licenses and dependencies. On old-copy, ownership, catalog or content conflicts, stop synchronization and preserve the work. Discussion, partial review and unrelated edits do not qualify.\n- Register the exact reviewed result: `/usr/bin/python3 [LOCAL_HOME]/project/02-ai-tools/codex-automations/skill-sync/tools/skill_sync.py --config [LOCAL_HOME]/.config/codex-skills/sync.json ready SKILL --group GROUP`.\n- This existing private-library authorization needs no renewed approval. It grants no authority over other repositories, accounts, platforms, publications, network services, third-party caches or system Skills. Hooks grant no trust or wider permissions.\n<!-- codex-skills-sync:end -->\n\n--- project-doc ---\n\n# OpenVela workspace rules\n\n- Use the user-level T0–T3 routing policy. Hardware/Flash/trust, chip/board and\n  AP/CP ownership, private-data decisions and final acceptance remain T3.\n- A physical board, serial/debug/download tool, board build output, GPU or\n  training run has one operator. Delegate only independent, bounded inputs.\n- Child agents do not spawn more agents, commit, push, flash, provision keys,\n  integrate unrelated edits or claim final acceptance.\n- In private-voice work, return aggregate counts, hashes, stage status and\n  quality metrics; do not expose source text/audio or identifying paths.\n- Build success is not board proof. Follow the source repository's instructions\n  and current board workflow for implementation and acceptance.\n\n\n<claude-mem-context>\n# Memory Context\n\n# [open-vela] recent context, 2026-10-13 4:28pm GMT+8\n\nNo previous sessions found.\n</claude-mem-context>\n</INSTRUCTIONS>\n<environment_context>\n  <cwd>[LOCAL_HOME]/project/01-embedded/open-vela</cwd>\n  <shell>bash</shell>\n  <current_date>2026-10-28</current_date>\n  <timezone>Asia/Shanghai</timezone>\n  <filesystem><workspace_roots><root>[LOCAL_HOME]/project/01-embedded/open-vela</root></workspace_roots><permission_profile type=\"disabled\"><file_system type=\"unrestricted\" /></permission_profile></filesystem>\n</environment_context>", "redacted_count": 5}
